#: lib/tuist_web/live/ops_account_live.ex:571
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Standing minutes need a subscription that renews monthly, and this one does not."
msgstr "常設分鐘數需要每月續期的訂閱，但此訂閱並非如此。"

#: lib/tuist_web/live/ops_account_live.html.heex:640
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Standing minutes unavailable"
msgstr "常設分鐘數不可用"

#: lib/tuist_web/live/ops_account_live.ex:568
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "This account has no active subscription to carry standing minutes."
msgstr "此帳戶沒有有效訂閱以承載常設分鐘數。"

#: lib/tuist_web/live/ops_account_live.ex:575
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "This account is on a runner trial, so standing minutes would buy credit it can never spend."
msgstr "此帳戶正處於執行器試用期，因此常設分鐘數會購買其永遠無法使用的額度。"

#: lib/tuist_web/live/ops_account_live.html.heex:630
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Standing minutes are a monthly item on the account's subscription. Stripe bills them on every renewal invoice and the minutes are granted once that invoice is finalized, shortly after the cycle opens, which is what a recurring prepaid arrangement needs, since minutes expire with the cycle they were bought for. Setting them leaves the cycle now running exactly as it is. Zero stops the arrangement."
msgstr "固定分鐘數係帳戶訂閱嘅每月項目。Stripe 會喺每張續訂發票中收取費用，而分鐘數會喺發票結算後、週期開始後不久發放。呢個係循環預付安排嘅必要做法，因為分鐘數會隨購買時所屬嘅週期一併過期。設定分鐘數會令現有週期如常運作。設為零則會終止此安排。"

#: lib/tuist_web/live/ops_account_live.ex:1156
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "%{count} instance was lowered and keeps its cache, evicting down to the new budget."
msgid_plural "%{count} instances were lowered and keep their caches, evicting down to the new budget."
msgstr[0] "%{count} 個實例已降級並保留其快取，逐出至新預算。"

#: lib/tuist_web/live/ops_account_live.ex:1150
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "%{count} instance was raised and rebuilds its volumes, one replica at a time behind the standby that keeps serving."
msgid_plural "%{count} instances were raised and rebuild their volumes, one replica at a time behind the standby that keeps serving."
msgstr[0] "%{count} 個實例已升級並重建其磁碟區，每次重建一個副本，喺持續提供服務嘅後備實例之後進行。"

#: lib/tuist_web/live/ops_account_live.ex:1149
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Kura disk claim moved to %{claim}."
msgstr "Kura 磁碟配額已移至 %{claim}。"

#: lib/tuist_web/live/ops_account_live.html.heex:206
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Sizing proposes growing the instances pinned below %{recommended} to it, the claim the account's other instances hold."
msgstr "容量調整建議將固定喺 %{recommended} 以下嘅實例擴展至該數值，即帳戶其他實例所持有嘅配額。"

#: lib/tuist_web/live/ops_account_live.ex:936
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The cache in %{region} has kept work for at least %{retention} before discarding it, when it needs to keep everything for %{floor}."
msgstr "%{region} 嘅快取喺丟棄前至少保留咗 %{retention} 嘅工作，但其實需要將所有內容保留 %{floor}。"

#: lib/tuist_web/live/ops_account_live.ex:1036
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "keeps work %{retention}, needs %{floor}"
msgstr "保留工作 %{retention}，需要 %{floor}"

#: lib/tuist_web/live/ops_account_live.html.heex:258
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Disk is sized automatically: the claim grows when the cache starts discarding work sooner than the plan promises to keep it, and shrinks when it goes a long time without filling up or keeps work for weeks longer than that. Growing rebuilds volumes one replica at a time behind the standby that keeps serving; shrinking keeps the cache and evicts down."
msgstr "磁碟自動調整大小：當快取開始丟棄工作嘅時間早於計劃承諾保留嘅時間時，配額會增加；而當長時間未填滿或保留工作嘅時間超過數週時，配額會減少。擴展時會喺持續提供服務嘅後備實例之後，每次重建一個磁碟區副本；縮減時則保留快取並逐出至較低水平。"
